.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK MILESTONE VIEW"
.SH NAME
hamstik milestone view \- View a milestone and one page of its releases
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik milestone view [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
View a milestone and one page of its releases
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ID
Milestone id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --release-after
The release cursor the release page starts after
.TP
.B --release-limit
Maximum releases per page
